config RA8E1_RUST_EXAMPLE
	bool "Rust Example Application"
	default n
	---help---
		Enable Rust demo application for FPB-RA8E1.
		Demonstrates Rust integration and functionality.
		Self-contained demo with no external app dependencies.
		Demonstrates code flash programming operations.
		Self-contained demo with no external app dependencies.

